    "special": {
      "value": "Leads to: Lightning Snares, Powerful Snares, Quick Snares, Ubiquitous Snares, Impossible Snares|APG, Trapsmith Dedication|G&G, Finessed Features|G&G, Gear Gnash|G&G, Propeller Attachment|G&G, Recycled Cogwheels|G&G, Repurposed Parts|G&G"
